    },
    {
      "id": "Q0nDChN09-aRvlslWgJIh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 229.8067820072174,
      "y": 3737.5050418376923,
      "width": 571.9993896484375,
      "height": 3150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1355522664,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 214181992,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772453122173,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "========================================\nDOUBLY LINKED LIST — UNSHIFT INTUITION\n========================================\n\n\nCASE 1: EMPTY LIST\n------------------\n\nBefore:\n\nhead → X\ntail → X\n\n\nOperation:\nunshift(10)\n\n\nAfter:\n\nhead        tail\n |           |\n v           v\n+--------+\n| val:10 |\n| prev:X |\n| next:X |\n+--------+\n\n\n\n========================================\n\n\nCASE 2: SINGLE NODE\n------------------\n\nBefore:\n\nhead        tail\n |           |\n v           v\n+--------+\n| val:10 |\n| prev:X |\n| next:X |\n+--------+\n\n\nOperation:\nunshift(5)\n\n\nSteps:\nnew.next = head\nhead.prev = new\nhead = new\n\n\nAfter:\n\nhead                tail\n |                   |\n v                   v\n+--------+    +--------+\n| val:5  |    | val:10 |\n| prev:X |<---| prev:5 |\n| next:10|--->| next:X |\n+--------+    +--------+\n\n\n\n========================================\n\n\nCASE 3: MULTIPLE NODES\n---------------------\n\nBefore:\n\nhead                        tail\n |                           |\n v                           v\n+--------+    +--------+    +--------+\n| val:10 |    | val:20 |    | val:30 |\n| prev:X |<---| prev:10|<---| prev:20|\n| next:20|--->| next:30|--->| next:X |\n+--------+    +--------+    +--------+\n\n\nOperation:\nunshift(5)\n\n\nSteps:\nnew.next = head\nhead.prev = new\nhead = new\n\n\nAfter:\n\nhead                                tail\n |                                   |\n v                                   v\n+--------+    +--------+    +--------+    +--------+\n| val:5  |    | val:10 |    | val:20 |    | val:30 |\n| prev:X |<---| prev:5 |<---| prev:10|<---| prev:20|\n| next:10|--->| next:20|--->| next:30|--->| next:X |\n+--------+    +--------+    +--------+    +--------+\n\n\n\n========================================\nONE-LINE INTUITION\n========================================\n\nunshift = attach new node BEFORE head\n\nnew.next  -> old head\nold.prev  -> new\nhead      -> new\n\nTIME COMPLEXITY: O(1)\nNO TRAVERSAL\n========================================",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "========================================\nDOUBLY LINKED LIST — UNSHIFT INTUITION\n========================================\n\n\nCASE 1: EMPTY LIST\n------------------\n\nBefore:\n\nhead → X\ntail → X\n\n\nOperation:\nunshift(10)\n\n\nAfter:\n\nhead        tail\n |           |\n v           v\n+--------+\n| val:10 |\n| prev:X |\n| next:X |\n+--------+\n\n\n\n========================================\n\n\nCASE 2: SINGLE NODE\n------------------\n\nBefore:\n\nhead        tail\n |           |\n v           v\n+--------+\n| val:10 |\n| prev:X |\n| next:X |\n+--------+\n\n\nOperation:\nunshift(5)\n\n\nSteps:\nnew.next = head\nhead.prev = new\nhead = new\n\n\nAfter:\n\nhead                tail\n |                   |\n v                   v\n+--------+    +--------+\n| val:5  |    | val:10 |\n| prev:X |<---| prev:5 |\n| next:10|--->| next:X |\n+--------+    +--------+\n\n\n\n========================================\n\n\nCASE 3: MULTIPLE NODES\n---------------------\n\nBefore:\n\nhead                        tail\n |                           |\n v                           v\n+--------+    +--------+    +--------+\n| val:10 |    | val:20 |    | val:30 |\n| prev:X |<---| prev:10|<---| prev:20|\n| next:20|--->| next:30|--->| next:X |\n+--------+    +--------+    +--------+\n\n\nOperation:\nunshift(5)\n\n\nSteps:\nnew.next = head\nhead.prev = new\nhead = new\n\n\nAfter:\n\nhead                                tail\n |                                   |\n v                                   v\n+--------+    +--------+    +--------+    +--------+\n| val:5  |    | val:10 |    | val:20 |    | val:30 |\n| prev:X |<---| prev:5 |<---| prev:10|<---| prev:20|\n| next:10|--->| next:20|--->| next:30|--->| next:X |\n+--------+    +--------+    +--------+    +--------+\n\n\n\n========================================\nONE-LINE INTUITION\n========================================\n\nunshift = attach new node BEFORE head\n\nnew.next  -> old head\nold.prev  -> new\nhead      -> new\n\nTIME COMPLEXITY: O(1)\nNO TRAVERSAL\n========================================",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TYwm3hyAlxZTITaa5BxyD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 238.6932438107424,
      "y": 6995.006135147672,
      "width": 132.85935058593694,
